  "details": "I am unable to rename avatars in the hierarchy, unless I first collapse the VRC Avatar Descriptor in the Inspector window.\nSteps to reproduce:\nSet up an avatar with a fully filled out VCR Avatar Descriptor. (No need to change anything in Playable Layers).\nAttempt to change the name of the avatar in the hierarchy.\nWorkaround:\nCollapse the VRC Avatar Descriptor component in the inspector window. You can now rename the object. However, if you expand the component again, you will lose the ability to rename again.",
